From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 10:41:44 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] arcana: 0042-announced-draw-replaced-whole

A ReplaceDrawWith that matches the draw announcement (EventPattern.
DrawCardsEvent: 'if a player would draw N or more cards, instead ...')
replaces the whole draw instruction (CR 614.1a, 121.2a). Previously the
announcement path reused the per-card shape and still drew N-1 cards
afterwards. No printed card used this shape before; Alms Collector
('If an opponent would draw two or more cards, instead you and that
player each draw a card') is the first.
---
 .../handlers/effects/drawing/DrawReplacementDispatcher.kt  | 7 ++++++-
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/rules-engine/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/engine/handlers/effects/drawing/DrawReplacementDispatcher.kt b/rules-engine/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/engine/handlers/effects/drawing/DrawReplacementDispatcher.kt
index 7b6fefbdff..0496c2f0df 100644
--- a/rules-engine/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/engine/handlers/effects/drawing/DrawReplacementDispatcher.kt
+++ b/rules-engine/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/engine/handlers/effects/drawing/DrawReplacementDispatcher.kt
@@ -198,12 +198,17 @@ class DrawReplacementDispatcher(
                         }
                     }
                     is ReplacementOutcome.Replaced -> {
+                        // An announcement-level replacement ("if an opponent would draw two or
+                        // more cards, instead …" — Alms Collector) replaces the whole draw
+                        // instruction (CR 614.1a, 121.2a): none of the announced cards are drawn
+                        // afterwards, unlike a per-card DrawEvent replacement, which replaces one
+                        // card and lets the rest of the instruction continue.
                         val ctx = processorResult.executionContext
                         if (ctx != null) {
                             return executeReplacement(
                                 processorResult.state, playerId,
                                 outcome.newEffect, ctx,
-                                totalCount - 1, isDrawStep,
+                                0, isDrawStep,
                                 processorResult.identity, state.activeReplacementChain, cycledCardId
                             )
                         }
